        "type": "link",
        "href": "https://play.rust-lang.org/?code=%23!%5Ballow(unused)%5D%0Afn+main()+%7B%0A++++let+mut+v+=+vec!%5B1,+2%5D;%0A++++%0A++++let+two+=+v.pop();%0A%7D&edition=2024",
        "title": "Run code",
        "children": []
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Vectors also support indexing (through the "
