            "title": "struct std::vec::Vec",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Vec"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " and a raw pointer allocated with the "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "https://corpus.test/alloc/struct.Global.html",
            "title": "struct std::alloc::Global",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Global"
              }
            ]
          },
