            "title": "associated function std::alloc::Layout::array",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Layout::array::<T>(capacity)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " may be converted into a vec using "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "https://corpus.test/struct.Vec.html#method.from_raw_parts",
            "title": "associated function std::vec::Vec::from_raw_parts",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Vec::<T>::from_raw_parts(ptr, len, capacity)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": ". Conversely, the memory backing a "
          },
          {
            "type": "inline_code",
            "code": "value: *mut T"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " obtained from "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "https://corpus.test/struct.Vec.html#method.as_mut_ptr",
            "title": "method std::vec::Vec::as_mut_ptr",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Vec::<T>::as_mut_ptr"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " may be deallocated using the "
          },
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "https://corpus.test/alloc/struct.Global.html",
            "title": "struct std::alloc::Global",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "inline_code",
                "code": "Global"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": " allocator with the same layout."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "For zero-sized types (ZSTs), or when the capacity is zero, the "
          },
